# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# GeneralWebsite NEXT-GEN — environment contract (Section 22)
# Validated with Zod at boot (lib/config/env.ts, instrumentation.ts) — fail fast.
# Copy to .env.local and fill in real values. NEVER commit real secrets.
#
# Demo values below are placeholders so a fresh checkout builds; replace them.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

